WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.110
- [Kelly] Well I know that you've talked

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.190
about this a billion times,

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.980
but my family will actually
kill me if I don't bring it up.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.210
So you're welcome...
- [Juliette] Okay.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.470
- [Kelly] I know people
have to always ask you

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.540
about Christmas Vacation, but like, I love

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.310
this movie and I know it's...
- How can I be mad at that?

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.020
- Well, I'm just saying it's been a minute

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.580
so maybe we shouldn't, but I just,

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.030
it's one of my favorite.
(audience cheers)

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.150
I have never, like, I
spend Christmas with you.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.390
Like, everyone does, like every,
that's an incredible thing.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:27.360
Like to make so many movie shows, music,

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.120
but to have this thing that's
like, so culturally just

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.290
in our brains.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.957
And in our, every year,
different generations.

00:00:33.957 --> 00:00:35.430
- No, no...
- [Kelly] Very few people

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.690
are part of something like that.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:37.523
- That's right.

00:00:37.523 --> 00:00:38.610
- Did you know it was gonna be like that?

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.510
- No, I did not.
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.130
- I did an interview yesterday.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:45.510
You know, I'm midlife, so I'm
going through many important,

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:48.690
emotional transitional things.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:52.560
Seizing beautiful, learning how
to appreciate what you have.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.870
And so I get really, (chuckles)

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:55.980
I'm gonna cry.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:56.813
- Oh you get emotional?
- You know,

00:00:56.813 --> 00:00:57.990
Christmas Vacation's so...

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.240
It's so touching.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.490
- That every year, as a little f...

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.323
I was just 15, sorry

00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:05.250
I didn't mean to cry...
- That's so cra...

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.080
No look, I cry so much on
this show. (audience applauds)

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.900
- [Juliette] No...
- They have it here for me.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.610
It's, it's an incredible
thing though, to be

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:12.600
a part of people's lives.
- [Juliette] Oh people.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.890
- Every Christmas...
- And they're like,

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:15.663
you're a part of my family.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:19.938
People who've lost their
parents or whatever.

00:01:19.938 --> 00:01:22.350
What, what it meant to them,

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.490
it's a tradition.
- You're a part of

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:24.780
those memories.
- And so what I'm saying is

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:25.613
No...

00:01:25.613 --> 00:01:28.620
You can never imagine,

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.750
that, is ever gonna happen.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.340
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- In a film you do.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:35.100
I was just 15 years old...
- [Kelly] That's so crazy

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:35.933
young.
- [Juliette] Yeah.

00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:37.050
- Wow.
- [Juliette] Chevy Chase

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:38.130
is really supportive.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.080
Johnny Galecki, who of course, who went

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:42.300
on to do Big Bang Theory...
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.803
- And many other things.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:48.360
And we were just the new
Griswold kids at that time.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:49.650
- It was amazing.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.450
Anyway, I had to bring it up
or my family would kill me.

